ls as well and to me  that is where i think you start to  explore those conversations up do we  look at a sixth year do we look at a  seventh year which is when dumbledore  should be arriving at hogwarts do we  look at post hogwarts because trust me i  am as excited as you guys are about  seeing a game that is able to completely  go past hogwarts into so many different  other areas of the wizarding world but i  think that is a topic for another day  the focus of this game is almost  certainly hogwarts itself as they talk  about in the trailer and in the little  director's reveal afterward and in case  you guys didn't see hogwarts legacy  actually is available for pre-order at  least in the us i've heard from some of  my uk friends that it's not up there  just yet keep an eye out guys i'm sure  it's only a matter of time i'll post  some links down in the description where  you can pre-order the game if you want  to go ahead and do that i know some  people hate pre-orders i get it if you  don't want to pre-order that's fine but  for the people that do i'm going to put  that down there but this actually leads  me to the next question and the reason i  haven't pre-ordered yet is because i  want to know will there be a collector's  edition we did a video on this several  months ago about what i think would be  some really cool things to include in a  collector's edition and in a world so  rich so full of lore like hogwarts like  harry potter there is an absolute  plethora of different things they could  include in this collector's edition that  would be awesome so i hope that they  know this i think that they know this  the fact that the game is coming  later this year if they are working on a  collector's edition that's something  that we should start to hear about soon  and to anyone at avalanche or wb who may  be watching this if you do a collector's  edition please make sure you have a  clear pre-order plan for us because  trust me there are going to be a lot of  people interested in this collector's  edition and the last thing you want to  happen is the whole ps5 pre-order fiasco  again where nobody knows when they're  going live and then a bunch of people  who want them miss out and the scalpers  buy them up we do not want that i've  already had fans hitting me up on  twitter saying hey please when you hear  about the pre-orders for collector's  edition let me know so if there's any  way that wb and avalanche could kind of  give us a little bit of lead time on  that and say hey this is happening  here's the day it's going to go up that  would be awesome because i absolutely  think these are gonna sell and they're  gonna sell big so please avalanche  collector's edition make it happen so  today we talked about seven big  questions that i still have about  hogwarts legacy but did you know there  are actually 55 things you may have  missed in that 14 minute gameplay  trailer if you want a full breakdown of  that trailer and all the little secrets  that i found check out the video on the  right side of your screen now as always  guys thank you all so much for watching  i'll talk to you again soon
 

